| Model | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| **UserProfile** | Extends Django User — phone, DOB, age, initials |
| **DailyEntry** | Sleep hours, work hours, expense, mood, notes (per date per user) |
| **Suggestion** | AI-generated lifestyle tips with category & severity |

🔑 Key Features
- **Email-based authentication** (login with email, not username)
- **Auto-generated suggestions** based on your tracked data patterns
- **Chart.js integration** — weekly activity chart + mood tracker
- **AJAX daily entry form** with real-time feedback
- **Responsive design** — sidebar collapses on tablet/mobile
- **Admin panel** at `/admin/` for data management
